      detail: `Checklist: Every user-based service account, MSA, gMSA and dMSA in the test domain is in the register once, and every account found only by a password that never expires has been confirmed or removed. Every app registration, service principal and managed identity in the admin center is in the register, with its type and home tenant. Every HIGH row (NPI-INV-01) is listed for the first wave, with its reasons. Every stale lead has been checked against domain controller and Entra sign-in logs, and nothing was retired on the lead alone. data-platform-handoff.csv has gone to the Data Platform plan. The app holds exactly Application.Read.All and Directory.Read.All, with Reader where user-assigned identities live, with a certificate or managed identity, never a secret. The cloud is explicit, nothing in a GCC configuration is a .us host, and the manifest's tenant ID is the tenant's. The manifest's hashes match the files handed to the ISSO. The pinned Learn pages match their manifests, and every upstream commit since the pin has been reviewed. Next: Chapter 02 — Ownership and the Orphan Rule.`,
